From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:43:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] iOS Fill icon pack + scroll-driven Glasmio navigation in the
 stage

- Add 55 iOS-style filled icons (ic_ixf_*), generated from Ionicons (MIT), and an "ios" icon pack
  that is now the default. Existing ic_xvox_ios_* drawables are reused for play/pause/skip/queue/
  lyrics/more. R8 keep rule added because icons are resolved by name.
- Route all 58 files through the app's painterResource wrapper so the pack applies everywhere.
- Stage: navigation bar follows page scroll (compact capsule + scroll hint), root tabs cross-fade,
  settings page shares its list state with the bar.
- THIRD_PARTY/IONICONS.md attribution.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
